%% Build-once, promote pipeline — see docs/adr/0004
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant PR as PR checks
    participant Build as build-and-scan.yml
    participant Reg as Registry (signed + SBOM)
    participant Stg as deploy-staging.yml
    participant Prod as promote-production.yml

    Dev->>PR: open PR (feature -> develop)
    PR->>PR: lint, IaC scan, secret scan, SAST, SCA, unit tests
    PR-->>Dev: required checks green, review approved
    Dev->>Build: merge to develop
    Build->>Build: build image (once)
    Build->>Build: Trivy + Grype scan (gate)
    Build->>Build: Syft SBOM
    Build->>Reg: push + cosign sign + attest SBOM
    Build->>Stg: trigger deploy
    Stg->>Reg: cosign verify (signature + SBOM)
    Stg->>Stg: blue/green deploy, migrate, smoke test, DAST (ZAP)
    Note over Stg: if any gate fails -> automatic rollback
    Dev->>Prod: workflow_dispatch (staging_run_id)
    Prod->>Prod: manual approval (GitHub Environment reviewer)
    Prod->>Reg: cosign verify SAME digest validated in staging
    Prod->>Prod: pre-deploy backup, blue/green deploy, smoke test
    Prod->>Prod: git tag release
